        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COSMIC ASCENT</strong> is a calm and thoughtful 2D puzzle platformer set against the endless backdrop of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a silent, determined heroine navigating a world built from starlight and stillness. No enemies. No combat. Just floating platforms, gravity-defying puzzles, and the quiet urge to climb higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, think, and feel your way through each level as you ascend toward something greater—something beyond the stars.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional puzzle platforming in a cosmic setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transparent platforms and spatial puzzles that test precision and timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet journey led by a female protagonist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist visuals and a soft, ambient atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calming soundtrack to guide your ascent</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COSMIC ASCENT</strong> is a calm and thoughtful 2D puzzle platformer set against the endless backdrop of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a silent, determined heroine navigating a world built from starlight and stillness. No enemies. No combat. Just floating platforms, gravity-defying puzzles, and the quiet urge to climb higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, think, and feel your way through each level as you ascend toward something greater—something beyond the stars.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional puzzle platforming in a cosmic setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transparent platforms and spatial puzzles that test precision and timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet journey led by a female protagonist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist visuals and a soft, ambient atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calming soundtrack to guide your ascent</p></li></ul>",
